{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>29歲足球主播兼歌手鄭杞瑤Kylie C.近日遠赴越南旅遊，在當地一間知名米芝蓮餐廳大歎高級料理時，以一身極具 …</p><p></p>\n<p>29歲足球主播兼歌手鄭杞瑤Kylie C.近日遠赴越南旅遊，在當地一間知名米芝蓮餐廳大歎高級料理時，以一身極具視覺衝擊力的打扮驚艷全場。她不但未有因為身處高級食府而收起性感，反而大方展露魔鬼身材，惹來大批網民瘋狂洗版。這輯震驚球迷的火辣照片一出，隨即在網絡上掀起一場關於衣著尺度的激烈討論。\n</p>\n<h2>Kylie C.現身越南米芝蓮餐廳大歎美食</h2>\n<p>鄭杞瑤Kylie C.前往越南旅遊放鬆期間，特別造訪了當地榮獲米芝蓮綠星榮譽的高級餐廳Nén Danang品嚐現代料理。當晚她身穿一件白色掛頸短身上衣，搭配低腰牛仔褲，大方曬出清晰可見馬甲線與迷人鎖骨。該件上衣採用極度深V剪裁設計，直接將豐滿上圍及事業線展露無遺，營造出極具衝擊力的視覺效果，而相片背景則展示了餐廳內部的環境與多道精美食物。</p>\n<h2>Kylie C.無懼目光大方展現個人自信</h2>\n<p>面對這身震撼眼球衣著打扮惹來的關注，當事人未有刻意閃避，反而透過個人社交平台公開分享這系列在餐廳內外拍攝的惹火影像。相片中她對著鏡頭擺出各種傲人姿勢，全程散發出滿滿自信魅力。事實上，她過去曾經公開表達過自己對衣著打扮的看法，並向外界表示「著咩都可以好性感」，直接陳述了她對於選擇服裝及展露天賦本錢的個人立場。\n</p>\n<h2>忠實阿仙奴球迷擁有歌手等多重身分</h2>\n<p>現年29歲鄭杞瑤Kylie C.一直在男球迷心目中擁有極高討論度，除了是一名稱職足球主播外，同時亦擁有歌手身分。身為英超球會阿仙奴忠實粉絲，她平日講述足球賽事時展現出專業知識，令她在男性主導足球圈子中突圍而出。她日常經常在社交平台向粉絲大派福利照，即使換上普通日常便服亦同樣吸引目光，每次更新動態都會吸引大批球迷密切留意及點讚。</p>\n<h2>震撼視覺衝擊惹大批網民驚呼太犯規</h2>\n<p>這輯在越南拍攝的中門大開辣照曝光後，迅速吸引大量網民湧入留言區熱烈討論，焦點全落在她極度誇張的身材及衣著打扮上。大批網民對其深V造型感到極大震撼，紛紛留言驚嘆「誇張」以及「好靚」。更有激動粉絲在帖文下方留下「太犯規，簡直係殺人，唔使用劍」的評價，直接以文字表達對這套服裝殺傷力的強烈感受。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179272403077267768_373122246adacc3fad353.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ckykylie_1792584869_4012813476081047850_20002748.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179272403077267768_373122246adacc3fad353.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：G@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179272403449442547_15412666516adacc42b41b3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ckykylie_1792584869_4012813485745019786_20002748.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179272403449442547_15412666516adacc42b41b3.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：G@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17916125870539459_6231284156ac9d6ab750c8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17916125870539459_6231284156ac9d6ab750c8.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>Kylie C以性感見稱，身材出眾（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17916125993949749_12911211226ac9d6b7d5a30.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17916125993949749_12911211226ac9d6b7d5a30.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179161259167458759_14178794196ac9d6b07f0e0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179161259167458759_14178794196ac9d6b07f0e0.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>她坦言希望大家留意其內涵。網民不睇好表示：「同叫人唔好留意美斯球技有咩分別」（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179161258943916797_16038786346ac9d6ae25346.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179161258943916797_16038786346ac9d6ae25346.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>以前好多福利（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/178209804238094662_18329332556a38a87b10339.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ckykylie_1779976016_3907044332413274601_20002748.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/178209804238094662_18329332556a38a87b10339.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ig@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/img_6155_104301126167357b023e79f-1024x1407.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"KylieC 鄭杞瑤 （圖片來源：ig@ckykylie）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/img_6155_104301126167357b023e79f-1024x1407.jpeg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ig@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/img_8545_12403989746846eda50c4bb-1024x740.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"KylieC 鄭杞瑤 （圖片來源：youtube@YS LABELS）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/img_8545_12403989746846eda50c4bb-1024x740.jpeg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：youtube@YS LABELS）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176976921905084042_395587618697c8903479ca.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"KylieC 鄭杞瑤 Kylie C.今年初出演ViuTV綜藝《足球女將》，並憑住對足球嘅認真獲唔少網民力讚！（圖片來源： IG＠ckykylie）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176976921905084042_395587618697c8903479ca.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>Kylie C.出演ViuTV綜藝《足球女將》，並憑住對足球嘅認真獲唔少網民力讚！（圖片來源： IG＠ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176976922422822276_1170638743697c890864dca.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"kylie c （圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176976922422822276_1170638743697c890864dca.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176976922358760071_1168632415697c8907c3990.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"kylie c 藍色。（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176976922358760071_1168632415697c8907c3990.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>藍色。（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176976922479058822_593936931697c890910270.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"kylie c 黃色。（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176976922479058822_593936931697c890910270.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>黃色。（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/vs-instagram-013_759461551679ec9b5334fb-1024x1320.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"kylie c （圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/vs-instagram-013_759461551679ec9b5334fb-1024x1320.png\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%b1%b3%e8%8a%9d%e8%93%ae/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">米芝蓮</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%84%ad%e6%9d%9e%e7%91%a4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭杞瑤</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%98%bf%e4%bb%99%e5%a5%b4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">阿仙奴</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3528627\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 23 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T04:24:07.934787+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1606,"images":14,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T02:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T04:18:40.852632+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T04:18:40.852632+00:00","content_hash":"ef3350ff4b49894f18a94ee8d13166c29e47e1bd415c6f4646c913296da86fd5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}